Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; RDS / VDI Deployment
; Tuned for Remote Desktop Services, Citrix, or non-persistent VDI hosts: applies TechSmith's documented virtualization optimizations, removes the printer-capture destination, keeps the Snagit Library path fixed, and puts update timing under IT control.
;
; Snagit 2025 and Snagit 2026 store these settings under different registry keys.
; This file includes both; only the section matching your installed Snagit version
; actually takes effect - the other is harmless and unused.
; HKEY_CURRENT_USER lines apply per-user; import under the target user's profile (or HKEY_USERS\<SID>\...).

; ----- Snagit 2025 -----
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\TechSmith\Snagit\25]
"VMOverride"="OtherVM"
"NoPrinterCaptureSupport"=dword:00000001
"DataStoreNoMove"=dword:00000001
"NoAutoUpdateSupport"=dword:00000001

; ----- Snagit 2026 -----
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\TechSmith\Snagit]
"VMOverride"="OtherVM"
"NoPrinterCaptureSupport"=dword:00000001
"DataStoreNoMove"=dword:00000001
"NoAutoUpdateSupport"=dword:00000001

